# UI / tokens (Cursor adapter)

Do not invent colours, radii, or parallel token systems.

1. Read `packages/token/AGENTS.md` and `packages/token/UI-RULES.md` before UI work.
2. Match the closest screen under `docs/design-system/reference/`.
3. Token value changes are R2 (shared boundary + governance gate).
4. Enforcement: `node scripts/check-tokens.mjs` via `pnpm check` / governance.
